sequenceDiagram
    participant Host as Raylib host
    participant Core as Core MapLoader
    participant Scene as Raylib backend scene
    participant Batch as Instanced batch lane
    participant Bridge as AgentBridge

    Host->>Host: Pump asset uploads
    Host->>Core: engine.Tick
    Core-->>Core: Create one map anchor entity
    Core-->>Host: MapLoaded deferred
    Host->>Scene: Poll backend scene residency
    Scene-->>Scene: Load glTF and texture
    Scene-->>Host: Resident
    Host->>Core: engine.Tick
    Core-->>Host: Combined gate ready
    Host->>Scene: Mark map ready
    Host->>Batch: Apply typed lane requests
    Batch-->>Host: One resident lane, 64 instances
    Host->>Scene: Draw backend model
    Host->>Bridge: Query entities and presenters
    Bridge-->>Host: 1 entity, 1 entity presenter, 0 scene entities

    Note over Core,Scene: Failure guard: either side failing cancels the other and releases its lease
